{"strongs": "H0380", "word": "אִישׁוֺן", "translit": "i.shon", "root": "איש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "pupil of eye", "definition": "אִישׁוֺן noun [masculine] pupil of eye (compare Dl HA 9 Prät LoPh, Feb. 1884 , but also Arabic , & Nö ZMG 1886, 739 ) — ׳ א all construct — עַיִן ׳ א Deut 32:10 ; Prov 7:2 בַּתעַֿיִן ׳ א Ps 17:8 (in all, simile of preciousness); = middle, midst of night לַיְלָה וַאֲפֵלָה ׳ בְּא Prov 7:9 חשֶׁח ׳ בְּא Prov 20:20 Kt i.e. in deep darkness ( Qr בֶּאֱשׁוּן see Now ). אִישַׁי see יִשַׁי .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB392')\">BDB392</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H380')\">H380</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB391')\">BDB391</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB393')\">BDB393</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אִישׁוֺן</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>pupil of eye</highlightword> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>HA 9</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Prä')\">Prät<sup>LoPh, Feb. 1884</sup></lookup>, but also Arabic <placeholder185/>, &amp; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>ZMG 1886, 739</sup></lookup>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> all construct — <bdbheb>עַיִן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,10)\">Deut 32:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 7:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,2)\">Prov 7:2</ref> <bdbheb>בַּתעַֿיִן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 17:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,8)\">Ps 17:8</ref> (in all, simile of preciousness); = <highlight>middle, midst</highlight> of night <bdbheb>לַיְלָה וַאֲפֵלָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 7:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,9)\">Prov 7:9</ref> <bdbheb>חשֶׁח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 20:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,20)\">Prov 20:20</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> i.e. <highlight>in deep darkness</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>בֶּאֱשׁוּן</bdbheb> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup>). </p><hr><p><bdbheb>אִישַׁי</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>יִשַׁי</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 32:10", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 32, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Prov 7:2", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ps 17:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 17, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Prov 7:9", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Prov 20:20", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 20, "verse": 20}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אִישׁוֺן", "׳", "א", "עַיִן", "בַּתעַֿיִן", "לַיְלָה וַאֲפֵלָה", "בְּא", "חשֶׁח", "בֶּאֱשׁוּן", "אִישַׁי", "יִשַׁי"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Dl", "Kt", "Now", "Nö", "Prä", "Qr"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB392", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}